(6599820, 984905, 136704, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and I love the barn.<br/> <br/>The purple aura at the edges it a bit too much, and the sky in uninteresting.<br/> <br/>I feel like the shutter speed is too long to make the water crisp, yet too short to make it dreamy. It might be due to the HDR process. Is this one (i.e. split into -2,0,+2 in PP) or more exposures merged?<br/> <br/>Lastly, I think HDR should be applied in situations where it adds to the image - I am pretty sure that you could fit the histogram in one exposure.</td>', 'Nice composition and I love the barn. The purple aura at the edges it a bit too much, and the sky in uninteresting. I feel like the shutter speed is too long to make the water crisp, yet too short to make it dreamy. It might be due to the HDR process. Is this one (i.e. split into -2,0,+2 in PP) or more exposures merged? Lastly, I think HDR should be applied in situations where it adds to the image - I am pretty sure that you could fit the histogram in one exposure.', '2011-11-21 08:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
