(6599865, 984950, 136704, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and friendly dog :)<br/> <br/>However, I don''t think the image needed any HDR editing. And - and this is a very personal opinion, I know - pets are extremely uninteresting. I get no story from the photograph.<br/> <br/>I think the crop is a bit too tight at the top and left side.</td>', 'Nice DOF and friendly dog :) However, I don''t think the image needed any HDR editing. And - and this is a very personal opinion, I know - pets are extremely uninteresting. I get no story from the photograph. I think the crop is a bit too tight at the top and left side.', '2011-11-21 08:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
