(6599878, 984881, 108069, '<td valign="top">Sweet scene. Beautiful. With all the exposure range to work with I''d love just a bit more light on the side of the ridge. It would give it a bit more depth and lead the eye in and around to the stunning sky. Just a thought.<br/> <br/>I''ll annoy you and take a guess as to who this might be, and most likely get it completely wrong: <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=96574" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Cuttooth</a>. In addition to the treatment, this reminds me of the north coast of Oahu.</td>', 'Sweet scene. Beautiful. With all the exposure range to work with I''d love just a bit more light on the side of the ridge. It would give it a bit more depth and lead the eye in and around to the stunning sky. Just a thought. I''ll annoy you and take a guess as to who this might be, and most likely get it completely wrong:  Cuttooth. In addition to the treatment, this reminds me of the north coast of Oahu.', '2011-11-21 08:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6599882, 984642, 101668, '<td valign="top">Great image and yet another contender for the blue. Good luck</td>', 'Great image and yet another contender for the blue. Good luck', '2011-11-21 08:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
