(6600226, 984940, 101668, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the title but a fallen tree is always sad. HDR soft and enhancing, nothing blown out. Nothing wow to this but great entry.<br/>Interesting, the bark looks like that of a pine tree but the fallen leafs are that of an oak. Curious.</td>', 'I don''t understand the title but a fallen tree is always sad. HDR soft and enhancing, nothing blown out. Nothing wow to this but great entry.Interesting, the bark looks like that of a pine tree but the fallen leafs are that of an oak. Curious.', '2011-11-21 12:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
