(6600359, 984774, 117534, '<td valign="top">OMG Breathtakeing.  I think I saw another one in this style in another challenge a while ago, and I have to say the same I did then...  WINNNNNER</td>', 'OMG Breathtakeing.  I think I saw another one in this style in another challenge a while ago, and I have to say the same I did then...  WINNNNNER', '2011-11-21 16:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
