(6600364, 984872, 117534, '<td valign="top">LOTS of Eye Candy here!! I like it very well, it may be a bit much on detail for others but I love it!</td>', 'LOTS of Eye Candy here!! I like it very well, it may be a bit much on detail for others but I love it!', '2011-11-21 16:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600366, 984868, 139906, '<td valign="top">Simply Great</td>', 'Simply Great', '2011-11-21 16:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600447, 984059, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great lines, and the strong shadows vs. the properly exposed backside of the fence shows an HDR mastery considering how natural and subtle the HDR manipulation has been throughout the entire photo. Clean, crisp production of a nice scene. Well done.</td>', 'Great lines, and the strong shadows vs. the properly exposed backside of the fence shows an HDR mastery considering how natural and subtle the HDR manipulation has been throughout the entire photo. Clean, crisp production of a nice scene. Well done.', '2011-11-21 18:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600448, 984559, 74559, '<td valign="top">Fabulous!</td>', 'Fabulous!', '2011-11-21 18:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600464, 984521, 60495, '<td valign="top">An old Silvertone Phonograh, One of my front page images is a shot of the same type needle head. I like the old time look ad fell of the image, nicely done.</td>', 'An old Silvertone Phonograh, One of my front page images is a shot of the same type needle head. I like the old time look ad fell of the image, nicely done.', '2011-11-21 19:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600479, 984716, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done....one of the few entries where the HDR hasn''t been over-cooked. Well composed, and well processed.</td>', 'Very nicely done....one of the few entries where the HDR hasn''t been over-cooked. Well composed, and well processed.', '2011-11-21 20:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600480, 984769, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very interesting take on the challenge....not the overly saturated colors as is typical for 90% of the entries! Great composition, and just wonderfully processed.</td>', 'Very interesting take on the challenge....not the overly saturated colors as is typical for 90% of the entries! Great composition, and just wonderfully processed.', '2011-11-21 20:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600481, 984872, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very heavily PP''ed.....but it works. Well. You have such a huge tonal range in this image, that HDR worked beautifully. Well done, top 5 for me.</td>', 'Very heavily PP''ed.....but it works. Well. You have such a huge tonal range in this image, that HDR worked beautifully. Well done, top 5 for me.', '2011-11-21 20:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600482, 984825, 124982, '<td valign="top">What a capture. HDR works in some areas (clouds, sky), but not so well in others (foreground). Nonetheless, really liked this image and voted it in my top 5.</td>', 'What a capture. HDR works in some areas (clouds, sky), but not so well in others (foreground). Nonetheless, really liked this image and voted it in my top 5.', '2011-11-21 20:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600485, 984702, 124982, '<td valign="top">The mark of a good HDR image is that you can''t really tell if HDR was applied or not. This is a perfect case in point...so wonderfully processed, I ccan barely see the tell-tale signs of HDR. Great composition, a pity about the bland landscape on the right of the image though. Maybe blurring it, or burning it would help to keep the eye focussed on your focal point? Anyway, top 5 for me! Good job!</td>', 'The mark of a good HDR image is that you can''t really tell if HDR was applied or not. This is a perfect case in point...so wonderfully processed, I ccan barely see the tell-tale signs of HDR. Great composition, a pity about the bland landscape on the right of the image though. Maybe blurring it, or burning it would help to keep the eye focussed on your focal point? Anyway, top 5 for me! Good job!', '2011-11-21 20:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600486, 984758, 124982, '<td valign="top">Such a lovely subject. Really like this one...love the tones and colors, think you did a great job with the processing. Top 5 for me!</td>', 'Such a lovely subject. Really like this one...love the tones and colors, think you did a great job with the processing. Top 5 for me!', '2011-11-21 20:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600487, 984924, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has such depth and richness.  I keep coming back.  It is really stellar.</td>', 'This has such depth and richness.  I keep coming back.  It is really stellar.', '2011-11-21 20:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600488, 984639, 15711, '<td valign="top">The long shadow makes it!!!</td>', 'The long shadow makes it!!!', '2011-11-21 20:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600489, 984872, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW  That''s some kind of lobby.</td>', 'WOW  That''s some kind of lobby.', '2011-11-21 20:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600490, 984881, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh those clouds!!!!!</td>', 'Oh those clouds!!!!!', '2011-11-21 20:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600491, 984819, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like it in BW.  Has a real mood to it.</td>', 'I like it in BW.  Has a real mood to it.', '2011-11-21 20:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600492, 984758, 97225, '<td valign="top">This subject is suited beautifully to this processing.</td>', 'This subject is suited beautifully to this processing.', '2011-11-21 20:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600493, 984464, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like that it has depth but isn''t overly processed.  Nice. 7</td>', 'I like that it has depth but isn''t overly processed.  Nice. 7', '2011-11-21 20:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600494, 984642, 124982, '<td valign="top">Really like this image...very different in the way its been processed with the single-toning. Definitely provides a refreshing change from the over-saturate kaleidoscope of color I''ve been seeing!</td>', 'Really like this image...very different in the way its been processed with the single-toning. Definitely provides a refreshing change from the over-saturate kaleidoscope of color I''ve been seeing!', '2011-11-21 20:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600495, 984905, 15711, '<td valign="top">Such gorgeous painterly colors!</td>', 'Such gorgeous painterly colors!', '2011-11-21 20:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600496, 984854, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh this is glorious.</td>', 'Oh this is glorious.', '2011-11-21 20:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600498, 984923, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene nicely processed.</td>', 'Beautiful scene nicely processed.', '2011-11-21 20:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600499, 984657, 15711, '<td valign="top">The birds almost mimic the trees up top.   I like that we can see there was movement in some of them, as they appear ghostly.  Nice. 7</td>', 'The birds almost mimic the trees up top.   I like that we can see there was movement in some of them, as they appear ghostly.  Nice. 7', '2011-11-21 20:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600500, 984932, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like it. ;)</td>', 'I like it. ;)', '2011-11-21 20:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600501, 984905, 97225, '<td valign="top">This looks like it belongs in the pages of an illustrated children''s story book.</td>', 'This looks like it belongs in the pages of an illustrated children''s story book.', '2011-11-21 20:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600502, 984952, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is totally unexpected.  I like the blur of the passer-by.  Would it have looked any different had you adjusted the curves/levels?  I''m craving a touch more of the shadow and midrange tones, since it isn''t a high key.  I do like it though.</td>', 'This is totally unexpected.  I like the blur of the passer-by.  Would it have looked any different had you adjusted the curves/levels?  I''m craving a touch more of the shadow and midrange tones, since it isn''t a high key.  I do like it though.', '2011-11-21 20:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600503, 984342, 97225, '<td valign="top">Very nice and natural looking processing.</td>', 'Very nice and natural looking processing.', '2011-11-21 20:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600504, 984559, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''ve come back to this 5 times.  Although I''m sure it is, it doesn''t have the look I''m expecting from HDR.  Maybe we usually don''t see it done as a macro with so much of the blur around the subject due to narrow DOF.  I like the lacy, dewy feel of the encased stem. 6</td>', 'I''ve come back to this 5 times.  Although I''m sure it is, it doesn''t have the look I''m expecting from HDR.  Maybe we usually don''t see it done as a macro with so much of the blur around the subject due to narrow DOF.  I like the lacy, dewy feel of the encased stem. 6', '2011-11-21 20:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600506, 984834, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has the most delicious sherbet colors!!</td>', 'This has the most delicious sherbet colors!!', '2011-11-21 20:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600507, 984738, 30669, '<td valign="top">Very Nice.</td>', 'Very Nice.', '2011-11-21 20:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600508, 984825, 30669, '<td valign="top">Very Cool Shot.</td>', 'Very Cool Shot.', '2011-11-21 20:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600509, 984743, 15711, '<td valign="top">The sky is wonderful.  The waves appear almost 3-D.  I really like the perspective and the pop of red from the roof. ;) (I would have expected a bit more blur from the movement of the waves since HDR is several exposures.)</td>', 'The sky is wonderful.  The waves appear almost 3-D.  I really like the perspective and the pop of red from the roof. ;) (I would have expected a bit more blur from the movement of the waves since HDR is several exposures.)', '2011-11-21 20:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600510, 984641, 15711, '<td valign="top">Did you ask those guys to freeze?  LOL  I like the feel of it.  Almost like a diorama and I''m peeking into the box to see the little scene in 3-D.</td>', 'Did you ask those guys to freeze?  LOL  I like the feel of it.  Almost like a diorama and I''m peeking into the box to see the little scene in 3-D.', '2011-11-21 20:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
