(6600631, 984872, 124815, '<td valign="top">Has the exact look of interiors from older books on "ameublement", furnishing and easy life. I am not fond of it as a photograph but it''s extremely useful as reference.</td>', 'Has the exact look of interiors from older books on "ameublement", furnishing and easy life. I am not fond of it as a photograph but it''s extremely useful as reference.', '2011-11-21 23:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
