(6600978, 984834, 61396, '<td valign="top">got confused by the shallow water movement, which made me initially think this is out of focus. Anyways, I like the way you colored the sky and water with green.</td>', 'got confused by the shallow water movement, which made me initially think this is out of focus. Anyways, I like the way you colored the sky and water with green.', '2011-11-22 14:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600992, 984944, 54446, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Love the star bursts from the lights.  Exquisite detail and clarity.  I assume HDR techniques gave better results than a single long exposure.  In any event, nice work.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Love the star bursts from the lights.  Exquisite detail and clarity.  I assume HDR techniques gave better results than a single long exposure.  In any event, nice work.', '2011-11-22 14:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600994, 984743, 54446, '<td valign="top">Very painterly look.  Lots of detail in the surf, which is sometimes lost with blended images.  Excellent control of the exposure.</td>', 'Very painterly look.  Lots of detail in the surf, which is sometimes lost with blended images.  Excellent control of the exposure.', '2011-11-22 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6600995, 984829, 54446, '<td valign="top">The steam clouds are awesome.  I think HDR techniques were well applied here.  Good job.</td>', 'The steam clouds are awesome.  I think HDR techniques were well applied here.  Good job.', '2011-11-22 14:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601004, 984797, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great pickup of colors in this image.  It''s very good photography.</td>', 'Great pickup of colors in this image.  It''s very good photography.', '2011-11-22 14:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601007, 984951, 54446, '<td valign="top">This is very good.  I might have taken the "rules risk" of cloning out the minor imperfections of people in the background, but they were there, weren''t they.  The floor, pews, walls, ceilings and windows are really great.  I''m glad you left some dark shadows in place, as it helps the realism.  Very slight halo on the back of the guy''s stocking cap, but not a problem.</td>', 'This is very good.  I might have taken the "rules risk" of cloning out the minor imperfections of people in the background, but they were there, weren''t they.  The floor, pews, walls, ceilings and windows are really great.  I''m glad you left some dark shadows in place, as it helps the realism.  Very slight halo on the back of the guy''s stocking cap, but not a problem.', '2011-11-22 14:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601035, 984944, 96751, '<td valign="top">There is much to enjoy in this beautiful wide angle - the soft glow over the city, the star refractions on the street lights.  But for some reason, that acid yellow bugs me.</td>', 'There is much to enjoy in this beautiful wide angle - the soft glow over the city, the star refractions on the street lights.  But for some reason, that acid yellow bugs me.', '2011-11-22 16:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
