(6601037, 984920, 96751, '<td valign="top">What a marvelous location</td>', 'What a marvelous location', '2011-11-22 16:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601038, 984673, 96751, '<td valign="top">What a glorious view.  I feel that the saturation has been pushed beyond acceptable for me, especially in the reds.  And I think you could have easily cropped a good portion off the bottom.</td>', 'What a glorious view.  I feel that the saturation has been pushed beyond acceptable for me, especially in the reds.  And I think you could have easily cropped a good portion off the bottom.', '2011-11-22 16:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601040, 984904, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOVE this!!!  Love the unclutteredness of it, and of course, the cats.</td>', 'LOVE this!!!  Love the unclutteredness of it, and of course, the cats.', '2011-11-22 16:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601041, 984774, 96751, '<td valign="top">Hmmmmm.  I feel like I''m looking at two different images - the upper sky one and the lower cactus one.  The transition between them seems too dark.  But those "tunas" look delicious.</td>', 'Hmmmmm.  I feel like I''m looking at two different images - the upper sky one and the lower cactus one.  The transition between them seems too dark.  But those "tunas" look delicious.', '2011-11-22 16:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601072, 984673, 100393, '<td valign="top">Shame about the sky. The rest is wonderful. Cropping just above the hill top would transform the image.</td>', 'Shame about the sky. The rest is wonderful. Cropping just above the hill top would transform the image.', '2011-11-22 17:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601279, 984673, 124815, '<td valign="top">Very attractive image. I figured out a while ago that the cloudy sky is not much favored by HDR. The water is wonderful, but the vines are a touch too saturated (more of the patchy shadow of the clouds would have been lovely) and the sky belongs stylistically to a different picture.  It''s certainly a place you want to revisit.</td>', 'Very attractive image. I figured out a while ago that the cloudy sky is not much favored by HDR. The water is wonderful, but the vines are a touch too saturated (more of the patchy shadow of the clouds would have been lovely) and the sky belongs stylistically to a different picture.  It''s certainly a place you want to revisit.', '2011-11-22 22:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601280, 984849, 124815, '<td valign="top">Modern interpretation of Dutch still life paintings. Great tonality. <br/>IMO, the letterbox borders are not suitable here. An entire dark charcoal border would be salutary though and would serve as a mat.</td>', 'Modern interpretation of Dutch still life paintings. Great tonality. IMO, the letterbox borders are not suitable here. An entire dark charcoal border would be salutary though and would serve as a mat.', '2011-11-22 22:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
