(6601283, 984944, 86218, '<td valign="top">Lovely Urban Night shot. HDR works for me here</td>', 'Lovely Urban Night shot. HDR works for me here', '2011-11-22 22:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601284, 984956, 124815, '<td valign="top">Finally a great HDR sky!</td>', 'Finally a great HDR sky!', '2011-11-22 22:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601285, 984059, 86218, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene HDR worked well and not to obvious. I would love to have seen more about what the actual business is on this farm.. Horses?, apple farm? whatever -  to complete the story for me here</td>', 'Lovely scene HDR worked well and not to obvious. I would love to have seen more about what the actual business is on this farm.. Horses?, apple farm? whatever -  to complete the story for me here', '2011-11-22 22:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601286, 984960, 124815, '<td valign="top">This is so charming that I wish that only his hands were in HDR! The HDR does not favor a bit this wonderful shot.</td>', 'This is so charming that I wish that only his hands were in HDR! The HDR does not favor a bit this wonderful shot.', '2011-11-22 22:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601288, 984909, 86218, '<td valign="top">Solid Urban landscape. I would have increased the sats a bit or even just the contrast slightly. A bit flat at the moment but the HDR has been handled well for it not to be overcooked</td>', 'Solid Urban landscape. I would have increased the sats a bit or even just the contrast slightly. A bit flat at the moment but the HDR has been handled well for it not to be overcooked', '2011-11-22 22:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601290, 984819, 124815, '<td valign="top">A clean image of Americana. HDR makes perfect sense without screaming at us.</td>', 'A clean image of Americana. HDR makes perfect sense without screaming at us.', '2011-11-22 22:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601292, 984825, 124815, '<td valign="top">Sewing the land to the sky! And in HDR. You surely did it.</td>', 'Sewing the land to the sky! And in HDR. You surely did it.', '2011-11-22 22:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601295, 984344, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like the immersive composition you chose.</td>', 'I really like the immersive composition you chose.', '2011-11-22 22:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601299, 984772, 86218, '<td valign="top">HDR Working well here to bring out the colours and punch the scene to a new level. Like the use of HDR in this way. I would have maybe cropped off a bit at the top to have the focus more on the main scene and thereby having this a pano format with black border to help the focus. Thats just me. :)</td>', 'HDR Working well here to bring out the colours and punch the scene to a new level. Like the use of HDR in this way. I would have maybe cropped off a bit at the top to have the focus more on the main scene and thereby having this a pano format with black border to help the focus. Thats just me. :)', '2011-11-22 22:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601325, 984758, 124815, '<td valign="top">The top left corner makes me think that the building is sleeping. And that the people inside are in their beds bolted to the side wall to face the sky. Superman gliding above.<br/>If not, I wish that the blue on the right would be toned down a notch.<br/>The greenish lemony reflection of the moon light is perfect.</td>', 'The top left corner makes me think that the building is sleeping. And that the people inside are in their beds bolted to the side wall to face the sky. Superman gliding above.If not, I wish that the blue on the right would be toned down a notch.The greenish lemony reflection of the moon light is perfect.', '2011-11-22 22:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601332, 984641, 124815, '<td valign="top">A good film set.</td>', 'A good film set.', '2011-11-22 22:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601335, 984774, 124815, '<td valign="top">I heard that once one approaches too much a certain type of cacti they throw spikes - just like poisonous arrows - and cover the intruder totally turning him into a sort of captured Gulliver. I imagine that they look very lovely, just like these ones. Delectable tonality.<br/>bump up</td>', 'I heard that once one approaches too much a certain type of cacti they throw spikes - just like poisonous arrows - and cover the intruder totally turning him into a sort of captured Gulliver. I imagine that they look very lovely, just like these ones. Delectable tonality.bump up', '2011-11-22 22:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601337, 984769, 124815, '<td valign="top">Almost a Chinese scroll. Such delicate details here, such a melodious composition. I would certainly crop the sky with its unnecessary reflections and bluish hue.<br/>bump up</td>', 'Almost a Chinese scroll. Such delicate details here, such a melodious composition. I would certainly crop the sky with its unnecessary reflections and bluish hue.bump up', '2011-11-22 22:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601338, 984863, 124815, '<td valign="top">Almost edible this honey dipped log. And whatever I make of the HDR it is pleasing here save for the sky that always looks painted with a feathery, sugary brush.<br/>bump up</td>', 'Almost edible this honey dipped log. And whatever I make of the HDR it is pleasing here save for the sky that always looks painted with a feathery, sugary brush.bump up', '2011-11-22 22:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601339, 984780, 124815, '<td valign="top">A girl suspended in time in a place where things are recognizable but oh, so foreign! Winsome.<br/>bump up</td>', 'A girl suspended in time in a place where things are recognizable but oh, so foreign! Winsome.bump up', '2011-11-22 22:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601347, 984773, 86218, '<td valign="top">Lovely sunrise (Ammie?) I think that maybe just to much emphasis has been placed on the sky. Although this is stunning it needs something more - more interest below to bring the eye back. (Im only trying to analyse this as you have mentioned that low votes have been forthcoming and explanation for it would be good)<br/>HDR in landscapes is very hard to present in a likeable fasion and this has been worked quiet nicely.</td>', 'Lovely sunrise (Ammie?) I think that maybe just to much emphasis has been placed on the sky. Although this is stunning it needs something more - more interest below to bring the eye back. (Im only trying to analyse this as you have mentioned that low votes have been forthcoming and explanation for it would be good)HDR in landscapes is very hard to present in a likeable fasion and this has been worked quiet nicely.', '2011-11-22 23:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601355, 984673, 86218, '<td valign="top">Wow. What magical light you had here. im just feeling that maybe there are two images here. Would love to have seen the focus to have been on top 2/3 of thw scene. The pond and growth in the f/g is just not gelling with the above scene and a real pity. The rolling hill with the vines and light and clouds over the hill is just magic and this allone would have been a top image for me 7</td>', 'Wow. What magical light you had here. im just feeling that maybe there are two images here. Would love to have seen the focus to have been on top 2/3 of thw scene. The pond and growth in the f/g is just not gelling with the above scene and a real pity. The rolling hill with the vines and light and clouds over the hill is just magic and this allone would have been a top image for me 7', '2011-11-22 23:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601358, 984799, 86218, '<td valign="top">Well composed and the simplicity in this works. HDR not overcooked and it really suits this castle. A knight on horse would really be so cool for this shot...but hey..let''s be real 8</td>', 'Well composed and the simplicity in this works. HDR not overcooked and it really suits this castle. A knight on horse would really be so cool for this shot...but hey..let''s be real 8', '2011-11-22 23:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6601359, 984953, 124815, '<td valign="top">An architect''s dream for a rendering. With all the coldness that they favor.<br/>As a photograph, I do not find it interesting in HDR. It''s losing the modulation of a light and shadow image.</td>', 'An architect''s dream for a rendering. With all the coldness that they favor.As a photograph, I do not find it interesting in HDR. It''s losing the modulation of a light and shadow image.', '2011-11-22 23:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
