(6604852, 984825, 101668, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bohemka:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m trying to be as annoying as possible and guess who this is: <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=86218" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">RianBotes</a> is the only DPCer I know that regularly churns out stunning lightning shots such as this. Of course if this is not Rian, please take it as a compliment.<br/> <br/>The sky is just magnificent, and the entire image is as crisp as can be. Awesome photo. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It''s not the lightning that gave it away this time, it''s the monument and the combination. A shot from a very talented man.</td>', 'Originally posted by bohemka: I''m trying to be as annoying as possible and guess who this is:  RianBotes is the only DPCer I know that regularly churns out stunning lightning shots such as this. Of course if this is not Rian, please take it as a compliment. The sky is just magnificent, and the entire image is as crisp as can be. Awesome photo.   It''s not the lightning that gave it away this time, it''s the monument and the combination. A shot from a very talented man.', '2011-11-28 01:31:36.000000', NULL, 0),
