(6605253, 984344, 89509, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene, captured perfectly. Anyone who shot film for years is aware of the light range limitations and knows how disapointing high contrast shots could be. Along comes an incredible tool like digital HDR to save the day and all anyone wants to do with it is turn every shot into the cheesy grunge look! Thank you for showcasing HDR''s potential!</td>', 'Beautiful scene, captured perfectly. Anyone who shot film for years is aware of the light range limitations and knows how disapointing high contrast shots could be. Along comes an incredible tool like digital HDR to save the day and all anyone wants to do with it is turn every shot into the cheesy grunge look! Thank you for showcasing HDR''s potential!', '2011-11-28 13:09:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(6605271, 984868, 86090, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your Ribbon. I have to say I admire your dedication and talent, and I agree with you about improvement. I''ll be looking forward to see your take on this one, again during winter.</td>', 'Congrats on your Ribbon. I have to say I admire your dedication and talent, and I agree with you about improvement. I''ll be looking forward to see your take on this one, again during winter.', '2011-11-28 14:00:42.000000', NULL, 0),
