(6605554, 984825, 18197, '<td valign="top">Rian ... this is a spectacular photo and truly deserves its position in the challenge. If I wanted to shoot storms, I can''t think of anyone I''d rather be storm-chasing with, than you. Maybe I should travel to SA to do it!?! Thanks for showing us mother nature with her ''game face'' on!</td>', 'Rian ... this is a spectacular photo and truly deserves its position in the challenge. If I wanted to shoot storms, I can''t think of anyone I''d rather be storm-chasing with, than you. Maybe I should travel to SA to do it!?! Thanks for showing us mother nature with her ''game face'' on!', '2011-11-28 23:02:52.000000', NULL, 0),
